+        // it is decided by the measured host-exposure test (`sched_stage_exposure_decides`), which stages
+        // when the gather's per-token host read is large enough to be worth the copy engine's overlap and
+        // keeps the gather when the set is resident (its costless case) or the profile is unknown.
